# ways — several ways between the same two areas are one line, and the mind chooses among them
#
# The Test Roof and the Test Hall are joined twice: by the Test Stair and by the Test Chimney. That
# is one line on the map, and both symbols stand on it side by side. While nothing is known of
# either, they are one question to a mind — "one of the ways between these two areas" — and the mind
# chooses which it looks at, as it does among the things of a kind on a card. So a mind that turns
# the question down is not asked it again whichever of the two symbols is clicked, and the next
# mind asked must look at one of them. Once one is observed the other is alone and is itself.
#
# --refuse-focus stands in for the choice judge answering "none of these", which --playground never
# does. A script may still name one of them: that pins the observation to it.
#
# FLAGS: --playground --skip-childhood --debug --seed 42 --no-encounters --auto-dialogue --location-type test --location-id 0 --start-area "Test Roof" --period dawn --refuse-focus

wait
click menu New
wait mode ProtagonistCreation 20
click continue
wait mode WorldView 60
travel here
wait mode LocationInteraction 60
advance 12 180

# --- both on the line, both unknown ---
expect-state symbols click observe "Test Stair" in "Test Roof" (way)
expect-state symbols click observe "Test Chimney" in "Test Roof" (way)
point observe "Test Stair"
wait 1
expect-state pointer-label ground=yellow text=observe · an unknown way

# --- asked about one of them, Childhood Memory turns the pair down ---
click observe "Test Stair"
choose childhood_memory
advance 12 180
expect-state trees refusal way="Test Stair" mind=childhood_memory
expect-no-state trees element

# --- and is not asked again about the other either: it is the same question ---
click observe "Test Chimney"
expect-state popup childhood_memory(refused)

# --- the next mind asked must look at one of the two: the declining is spent ---
choose comradeship
advance 12 180
expect-state trees element "Test Chimney"
expect-no-state symbols click observe "Test Chimney"

# --- the one left is alone on its question: Childhood Memory may be asked about it ---
click observe "Test Stair"
expect-no-state popup (refused)
choose childhood_memory
advance 12 180
expect-state trees refusal way="Test Stair" mind=childhood_memory
quit
